<title>USA: Planet Digital picks U.S. Robotics hub.</title>
<headline>Planet Digital picks U.S. Robotics hub.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Thursday its Total Control Enterprise Network Hub was chosen as the exclusive communications platform by Planet Digital Network Technologies.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>U.S. Robotics said Planet, which provides Internet, Intranet, local and long-distance service, will offer U.S. Robotics' x2 high-speed modem technology in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
